   "widgets_values": [
    "### 3 · RIFE VFI\n**rife47**, multiplier **2** (24 → 48 fps; ×3 → 72 fps needs ~61 GB RAM at 1536×1920×124 f), fast_mode on, ensemble on, scale_factor 1.\nclear_cache_after_n_frames 10 keeps VRAM flat. Interpolated frames are clean (only fast hand moves blur slightly).\nfps must equal 24 × multiplier, otherwise the motion speed changes."
   ]
  },
